{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 4, :comments ["<b>And his brothers saw that their father loved him.</b> And in this Jacob erred, in differentiating among the sons in a matter such that the brothers would recognize the love that was in his heart." "<b>And they could not speak to him for peace.</b> Even though they needed to speak with him concerning the management of the household and the tending of the flocks — he being in charge under his father's command — they could not speak with him for peace and friendship, as is the way of brothers."], :book :genesis, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 37, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:33:31.283983593Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}